1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Clap your hands, clap clap clap!

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,500
Stomp your feet, stomp stomp stomp!

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,500
Jump up high, jump jump jump!

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Spin around, spin spin spin!

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Clap, stomp, jump, spin
Do it all again!

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,500
Touch your head, head head head!

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,500
Touch your nose, nose nose nose!

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,500
Touch your ears, ears ears ears!

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,500
Touch your toes, toes toes toes!

10
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Head, nose, ears, toes
Touch them all again!

11
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,500
Shake your hands, shake shake shake!

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,500
Wave hello, wave wave wave!

13
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,500
March in place, march march march!

14
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,500
Take a bow, bow bow bow!

15
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Shake, wave, march, bow
You did a great job!
